      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Yukiko Kada was appointed as the Chief of the MPD, marking a significant departure from traditional police leadership and making her the first non-American and first woman to hold the position."</data>
      <data key="d5">"new leadership, diversity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0457</data>
